    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vengeance</strong> is a fast-paced 2D bullet hell roguelike where survival depends on your reflexes, positioning, and ability to stay calm in chaos. Dive into arenas flooded with enemies, dodge an onslaught of projectiles, and stay alive for as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session ramps up the intensity \u2014 no grinding, no inventory, just you against overwhelming odds. The longer you survive, the more brutal it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong><br>\u2022 \ud83c\udf00 Pure bullet hell action \u2013 survive wave after wave of relentless enemies<br>\u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Tight, responsive controls \u2013 your movement is your greatest weapon<br>\u2022 \ud83d\udd25 Skill-based progression \u2013 improve through mastery, not loot<br>\u2022 \ud83c\udfae Short, intense sessions \u2013 perfect for quick adrenaline bursts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Over 10 unique enemy types</strong> that evolve across levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83d\udc79 <strong>2 handcrafted boss encounters</strong>, each with multiple phases and unique mechanics</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vengeance</strong> is a fast-paced 2D bullet hell roguelike where survival depends on your reflexes, positioning, and ability to stay calm in chaos. Dive into arenas flooded with enemies, dodge an onslaught of projectiles, and stay alive for as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session ramps up the intensity \u2014 no grinding, no inventory, just you against overwhelming odds. The longer you survive, the more brutal it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong><br>\u2022 \ud83c\udf00 Pure bullet hell action \u2013 survive wave after wave of relentless enemies<br>\u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Tight, responsive controls \u2013 your movement is your greatest weapon<br>\u2022 \ud83d\udd25 Skill-based progression \u2013 improve through mastery, not loot<br>\u2022 \ud83c\udfae Short, intense sessions \u2013 perfect for quick adrenaline bursts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Over 10 unique enemy types</strong> that evolve across levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83d\udc79 <strong>2 handcrafted boss encounters</strong>, each with multiple phases and unique mechanics</p>",
    "short_description": "Face endless waves. Dodge. Survive. Repeat. Vengeance is a fast-paced 2D bullet hell roguelike where you're thrown into a chaotic battlefield swarming with enemies. Master your movement, survive as long as you can. Every second counts, and one wrong step means game over.",
